<title>NETHERLANDS: ATHLON FIRST-HALF NET UP 10 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>ATHLON FIRST-HALF NET UP 10 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>HOOFDDORP, Netherlands 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)		5.59 vs   5.00</p>
<p>    Net profit			     10.6  vs   9.6</p>
<p>    Turnover				401    vs 360</p>
<p>NOTE - Automobile group Athlon Groep NV said in March it</p>
<p>expected the net profit from ordinary operations to rise in 1996</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
